        "semanticZoom": {
          "resolution": 1
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Weekend Reading Group\n\nSix of us are reading one short book over four Saturdays. Nobody has to finish early, and nobody has to have an opinion before we meet.\n\n## The four Saturdays\n\n1. **Week 1:** the first third. Say what surprised you.\n2. **Week 2:** the middle third. Say what you disagree with.\n3. **Week 3:** the last third. Say what you would change.\n4. **Week 4:** no reading. Each person brings one passage and reads it aloud.\n\n## How a meeting goes\n\nThe host for the week opens with one question and keeps time. We stop at noon. The host changes every week, in the order we signed up."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "ownsContent": true,
          "surfaceDelegation": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "weekend-reading-group",
          "nodeId": "rg-detail"
